# 09 Scale test - 2026-11-18T17:01:04Z
Isolated: schema serverless_stable_seg9n6_catalog.vuln_poam_scale, pipeline d29202aa-da7a-40b5-b63e-e9260605b621 (serverless). Demo tables, Genie and the app were not touched.
Data: data_gen/generate_scans_scale.py (deterministic, hash-based). 200 systems, 30,000 hosts, 2,000 CVEs, ~299k unique findings, each persisting 1-6 weekly scans; ~0.5% deliberately dirty rows.
SCOPE: ingest -> validate -> silver -> gold only. NOT tested at this scale: Lakebase sync, the app's queries, the ML scoring, Genie.
CAVEAT: single run each, serverless autoscaling, no repeat; treat durations as indicative, not a benchmark.

